  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "This report investigates the phenomenon of deceptive safety alignment in large reasoning models, addressing how intermediate reasoning and final answers can be inconsistent with safety signals. It explores how cross-lingual safety alignment can be improved through the use of reasoning traces and response representations to mitigate potential harms.",
